{"seq":3,"slug":"forecasting-and-curtailment","title":"功率预测与弃电","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/renewable-integration/forecasting-and-curtailment","wordCount":2027,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"功率预测与弃电\">功率预测与弃电</h1><p>风把叶片转得有多快、云什么时候遮住光伏阵列，这些气象事件最终会变成电网调度室里的一行数字：未来某个时段这片场站能交出多少兆瓦。预测得越准，电网就敢留越少的备用容量给它兜底；预测得越糊，调度员就越倾向于在供大于求时直接把它的出力压下去——这就是弃电。功率预测与弃电因此是一根链条的两端：预测误差决定了电网愿意为可再生能源腾出多大的接纳空间，而接纳空间不足又直接表现为被切掉的清洁电量。</p>\n<p>2025 年这根链条绷得更紧了。国家能源局披露，2025 年全国风电平均利用率约 94%、光伏利用率约 95%，较 2024 年初的 96%/95.7% 双双回落（<a href=\"https://www.nea.gov.cn/20260212/742b8c6a078347b0b39de676c05c5d58/c.html\">国家能源局《2025 年可再生能源并网运行情况》</a>）。西北多省光伏弃置率逼近 10%，根因是装机增速远超电网承载——截至 2024 年底全国新能源装机已破 14 亿千瓦，光伏单年新增增速超 45%。海外同样吃紧：巴西 2025 年风光合计弃电率达 20.6%，比上年的 9.3% 翻倍；西班牙 2025 年 7 月弃电率冲到近 11%（<a href=\"https://enline.energy/articles/renewable-curtailment-2026-utility-solutions\">Enline《Renewable Energy Curtailment in 2026》</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从气象不确定性到被切掉的兆瓦\">核心概念：从气象不确定性到被切掉的兆瓦</h2><p>要理解这条链条，先看清各环节如何把上游的不确定性逐级传递到末端的弃电决策。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[气象输入&lt;br/&gt;NWP 数值天气预报 / 卫星云图 / 测风塔] --&gt; B[功率预测模型&lt;br/&gt;物理模型 + 机器学习]&#10;    B --&gt; C[确定性点预测&lt;br/&gt;未来各时段出力 MW]&#10;    B --&gt; D[概率预测&lt;br/&gt;分位数 / 置信区间]&#10;    C --&gt; E[日前申报&lt;br/&gt;机组组合 unit commitment]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F{电网可接纳?&lt;br/&gt;断面 / 调峰 / 稳定约束}&#10;    F --&gt;|余量充足| G[全额消纳]&#10;    F --&gt;|超出承载| H[弃电 curtailment&lt;br/&gt;下压出力]&#10;    H --&gt; I[弃电量统计&lt;br/&gt;利用率 / 弃风弃光率]&#10;    I --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n    A[气象输入&lt;br/&gt;NWP 数值天气预报 / 卫星云图 / 测风塔] --&gt; B[功率预测模型&lt;br/&gt;物理模型 + 机器学习]\n    B --&gt; C[确定性点预测&lt;br/&gt;未来各时段出力 MW]\n    B --&gt; D[概率预测&lt;br/&gt;分位数 / 置信区间]\n    C --&gt; E[日前申报&lt;br/&gt;机组组合 unit commitment]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F{电网可接纳?&lt;br/&gt;断面 / 调峰 / 稳定约束}\n    F --&gt;|余量充足| G[全额消纳]\n    F --&gt;|超出承载| H[弃电 curtailment&lt;br/&gt;下压出力]\n    H --&gt; I[弃电量统计&lt;br/&gt;利用率 / 弃风弃光率]\n    I --&gt; B</pre><p>预测误差与弃电的关系并不对称。预测偏低（低报）时，调度据此少留接纳空间，实际多发的电只能临时弃掉；预测偏高（高报）时，电网为不存在的出力预留了走廊，浪费了本可给别人的容量。这种「过预测代价 ≠ 欠预测代价」的非对称性，正是概率预测要解决的核心问题。</p>\n<p>下表对比三类时间尺度的预测，它们服务于完全不同的电网决策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间尺度</th>\n<th>预测时段</th>\n<th>主导方法</th>\n<th>服务的电网决策</th>\n<th>典型误差量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>超短期</td>\n<td>0–4 小时</td>\n<td>卫星云图外推、雷达、统计外推</td>\n<td>实时调度、AGC、备用调用</td>\n<td>光伏 NMAE 3%–6%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短期</td>\n<td>4 小时–3 天</td>\n<td>NWP + 机器学习后处理</td>\n<td>机组组合、日前市场申报</td>\n<td>光伏 NMAE 3.3%–8.6%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中长期</td>\n<td>3 天–数周</td>\n<td>集合 NWP、气候态统计</td>\n<td>检修计划、燃料采购、水库调度</td>\n<td>误差随时段快速放大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数值天气预报-误差的最上游\">数值天气预报：误差的最上游</h2><p>可再生能源功率预测的精度天花板，几乎全压在数值天气预报（NWP）这一层。光伏出力由到达组件平面的辐照度决定，风电出力由轮毂高度风速的三次方决定——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{wind} \\propto v^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这条立方关系意味着风速预测误差会被放大三倍，一个 10% 的风速偏差能造成约 30% 的功率偏差。这也是风电预测普遍比光伏更难的根本原因。</p>\n<p>主流场站直接消费欧洲中期天气预报中心（ECMWF）等机构的集合预报（ensemble forecast）：同一初始时刻跑出几十条略有扰动的预测轨迹，用轨迹的离散程度刻画不确定性。但集合成员常有「离散不足」（under-dispersion）的毛病——给出的置信区间偏窄、显得过于自信，因此需要统计后处理来校准，常用分位数回归（QR）或集合模式输出统计（EMOS）（<a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0960148123008996\">ScienceDirect《Combining quantiles of calibrated solar forecasts》</a>）。</p>\n<p>辐照度从全球水平辐照（GHI）转换到组件平面辐照（POA）这一步也引入误差。2026 年的研究里，把卫星反演的 GHI 经七种机器学习模型转成日前 POA 已成为标准管线（<a href=\"https://www.mdpi.com/1996-1073/19/11/2653\">MDPI Energies, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"机器学习预测模型-从点预测到概率预测\">机器学习预测模型：从点预测到概率预测</h2><p>传统统计模型（ARIMA、持续法）抓不住辐照度和风速的非线性时序模式，这正是深度学习介入的切口。2026 年的实践已经分化出几条清晰路线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时序深度网络</strong>：两层堆叠 LSTM（如 128+64 神经元、56 步约 4.7 小时输入窗）同时捕捉短程与中程依赖；Informer 集合用于日前多步光伏预测以压低累积误差（<a href=\"https://www.frontiersin.org/journals/energy-research/articles/10.3389/fenrg.2026.1730179/full\">Frontiers in Energy Research, 2026</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>物理信息机器学习（PINN）</strong>：把太阳几何、晴空模型等物理约束写进损失函数，在样本稀疏的时段也不至于给出违背物理的出力。</li>\n<li><strong>集成与后处理</strong>：把多个模型的输出再做一次集成，是 2026 年风电预测拿到最高精度的常见手法（<a href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-025-05250-3\">Nature Scientific Reports, 2025</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>模型选型并非越复杂越好。一项对比显示，简单线性回归就能把光伏 NMAE 从 8.6% 降到 3.59%，神经网络再进一步压到 3.34%（<a href=\"https://www.mdpi.com/1996-1073/19/2/550\">MDPI Energies, 2026</a>）——增量收益递减，工程上要权衡运维成本。</p>\n<p><strong>概率预测</strong>是当前重点。点预测只给一个数，概率预测给出整条分布。训练时用弹球损失（pinball loss）来逼合分位数：对目标分位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，损失定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>q</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>≥</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_q(y, \\hat{y}) = \\begin{cases} q\\,(y - \\hat{y}) &amp; y \\geq \\hat{y} \\\\ (1-q)\\,(\\hat{y} - y) &amp; y &lt; \\hat{y} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它对高报与低报施加非对称惩罚，恰好刻画了前文提到的「过预测代价 ≠ 欠预测代价」（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1710.01720\">arXiv《Smooth Pinball Neural Network for Wind Power》</a>）。调度据此能区分「大概率发 80MW」和「50%概率 80MW、有长尾风险」，从而把备用容量留得更精准。气象界把同套思路推得更远：2025 年起机器学习天气模型（如 GenCast 类方法）开始产出可与传统集合预报匹敌的概率预报（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2511.16164\">arXiv 2025</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"弃电的成因-衡量与治理\">弃电的成因、衡量与治理</h2><p>弃电不是单一现象，而是几类电网约束的共同出口。把成因拆清楚，才知道哪种治理手段对症。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[弃电成因] --&gt; B[输电断面受限&lt;br/&gt;送出通道堵塞]&#10;    A --&gt; C[调峰能力不足&lt;br/&gt;夜间负荷低 + 刚性出力]&#10;    A --&gt; D[系统稳定约束&lt;br/&gt;惯量 / 频率 / 电压]&#10;    A --&gt; E[供需时空错配&lt;br/&gt;午间光伏过剩]&#10;    B --&gt; F[治理: 特高压 HVDC&lt;br/&gt;扩输电投资]&#10;    C --&gt; G[治理: 储能调峰&lt;br/&gt;需求侧响应]&#10;    D --&gt; H[治理: 构网型逆变器&lt;br/&gt;调相机 / 同步惯量]&#10;    E --&gt; I[治理: 电价信号&lt;br/&gt;绿电直连大用户]\">graph TD\n    A[弃电成因] --&gt; B[输电断面受限&lt;br/&gt;送出通道堵塞]\n    A --&gt; C[调峰能力不足&lt;br/&gt;夜间负荷低 + 刚性出力]\n    A --&gt; D[系统稳定约束&lt;br/&gt;惯量 / 频率 / 电压]\n    A --&gt; E[供需时空错配&lt;br/&gt;午间光伏过剩]\n    B --&gt; F[治理: 特高压 HVDC&lt;br/&gt;扩输电投资]\n    C --&gt; G[治理: 储能调峰&lt;br/&gt;需求侧响应]\n    D --&gt; H[治理: 构网型逆变器&lt;br/&gt;调相机 / 同步惯量]\n    E --&gt; I[治理: 电价信号&lt;br/&gt;绿电直连大用户]</pre><p>衡量弃电有两个互补口径。<strong>利用率</strong>关注实际发了多少：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta_{util} = \\frac{E_{actual}}{E_{theoretical}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">eor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{theoretical}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">eor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是无约束情况下本应发出的电量。<strong>弃电率</strong>则是被切掉的比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{curt} = 1 - \\eta_{util}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。2024 年全球弃电量同比激增约 55%，风电约 4.1%、光伏约 3.2%；得益于 HVDC 扩张与储能铺开，预计稳定在 5%–6%（<a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/renewables-2025/renewable-electricity\">IEA《Renewables 2025》</a>）。但区域差异巨大：CAISO 在 2024 年弃掉 340 万兆瓦时风光、同比增 29%，全美年弃电量约 2000 万兆瓦时（<a href=\"https://www.amperon.co/blog/us-solar-and-wind-curtailment-is-exploding\">Amperon《US Solar and Wind Curtailment Is Exploding》</a>）。</p>\n<p>治理上有两条主线相互配合。<strong>扩硬件接纳能力</strong>：2025 年美国输配电资本开支预计达 849 亿美元、同比增约 120 亿美元，规划输电项目同比增 25%（<a href=\"https://enline.energy/articles/renewable-curtailment-2026-utility-solutions\">Enline, 2026</a>）。<strong>用市场与算法把现有容量榨干</strong>：2025 年中国出台规则允许新能源场站配储后与大工业用户绿电直连，绕过公共电网瓶颈对齐供需（<a href=\"https://www.nea.gov.cn/20260212/742b8c6a078347b0b39de676c05c5d58/c.html\">国家能源局, 2026</a>）。而这两条线的效率上限，又回到了预测——预测越准，留给「不确定性」的弃电缓冲就越薄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>功率预测与弃电是同一根链条：预测误差决定电网愿意腾出的接纳空间，空间不足直接表现为被切掉的清洁电量。</li>\n<li>误差的最上游是数值天气预报；风电因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\propto v^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的立方关系，风速误差被放大三倍，普遍比光伏更难预测。</li>\n<li>2026 年模型主流是 LSTM / Informer 等深度时序网络 + 物理信息约束 + 集成后处理；简单模型已能把光伏 NMAE 压到 3%–4%，复杂模型增量收益递减。</li>\n<li>概率预测用弹球损失逼合分位数，刻画「过预测代价 ≠ 欠预测代价」的非对称性，让电网把备用容量留得更精准。</li>\n<li>2025 年消纳形势趋紧：中国风电利用率回落到 94%、光伏 95%，巴西弃电率翻倍至 20.6%；治理靠「扩输电/储能硬件」与「绿电直连/市场信号」两条线，而两者效率上限都受预测精度约束。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"功率预测与弃电","id":"功率预测与弃电"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从气象不确定性到被切掉的兆瓦","id":"核心概念-从气象不确定性到被切掉的兆瓦"},{"level":2,"text":"数值天气预报：误差的最上游","id":"数值天气预报-误差的最上游"},{"level":2,"text":"机器学习预测模型：从点预测到概率预测","id":"机器学习预测模型-从点预测到概率预测"},{"level":2,"text":"弃电的成因、衡量与治理","id":"弃电的成因-衡量与治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"逆变器电源与电网稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/renewable-integration/inverter-based-resources-and-stability"},"next":{"title":"需求响应与灵活性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/flexibility-and-markets/demand-response-and-flexibility"}}